Mac Catalyst: native panels own game input while they are open.

GCKeyboard updates SDL independently of UIKit's responder, and pausing level
simulation does not pause the game's menus. Neutralize engine input reads while
the native shell is modal or inactive, preserving controller device events and
consuming text/relative motion rather than replaying them when the panel closes.
The compile-time zero leaves the iOS, visionOS and desktop paths unchanged.

--- a/port/src/input.c
+++ b/port/src/input.c
